      {"unit": 10, "theme": "C2 capstone", "genres": ["multi-source-style synthesis", "complex paired texts", "final checkpoint"]}
    ]
  },
  "variation_rules": [
    "Do not translate one language's passage into the other two; preserve comparable pedagogical load but write naturally for each language.",
    "Across each six-passage unit, vary at least two of narrator/speaker, setting, genre, discourse organization, and question representation.",
    "At A1-A2, keep early R1/R2 contexts thematically coherent before wider transfer.",
    "At B1+, increase cross-topic contextual diversity and interleaving.",
    "At C1-C2, include academic, professional, journalistic, explanatory, and literary/critical registers without making archaic language the default.",
    "Factual informational passages require source-fact verification; fictional passages must not masquerade as factual reports."
  ]
}
